    "media:imagetext": "50\nTHE GOLDEN GATE BRIDGE\nThe total length of the Golden Gate Bridge is 8,943\nfeet.\nThe length of each cable, 7,770 feet, containing\n27,572 wires. The total length of wire in cables, 80,000\nmiles; enough to build a standard woven wire fence six\nfeet in height from San Francisco to New York City.\nThe United Airlines \"Mainliner\" may be seen in the\nforeground of this picture.\nNo. 104\nPHOTOGRAPH COURTESY OF\nSTANDARD OIL COMPANY OF CALIFORNIA\nFOR CORRESPONDENCE\nPOST CARD\nTHIS SPACE FOR ADDRESS ONLY\nPLACE\nONE CENT\nSTAMP\nHERE\nPUB. BY J. C. BARDELL, SAN FRANCISCO\n20151661619",
